<title>POLAND: AMERBANK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.94 vs    0.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.57 vs    0.98</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.31 vs    3.14</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.33 vs    4.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
